  <h2>Who We Are</h2>
  <p>Dividend Guide is an independent educational resource for dividend investors. We publish curated stock lists, interactive calculators, and strategy comparisons to help you make informed decisions about building passive income through dividend-paying stocks.</p>
  <p>Our content is written and fact-checked by <a href="/about/author/">Henry Zhou</a>, Independent Dividend Researcher. Each article documents its data sources, calculation method, and the date on which market figures were checked.</p>
  <h2>Editorial Standards</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Data-driven:</strong> All stock metrics and statistics are sourced from publicly available financial data providers including S&amp;P Global, Morningstar, and SEC filings.</li>
    <li><strong>Transparent:</strong> Every factual claim is linked to its source. We clearly distinguish between verified data and editorial analysis.</li>
    <li><strong>No hype:</strong> We do not make buy/sell recommendations or provide personalized financial advice.</li>
    <li><strong>Regular updates:</strong> Stock lists and market statistics are reviewed and updated quarterly.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>Dividend Guide is for informational and educational purposes only. Nothing on this site constitutes financial advice. Past performance does not guarantee future results. Always conduct your own research and consult with a qualified financial advisor before making investment decisions.</p>
